none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;\">\n<span style=\"color: black;font-family: Calibri, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           关于Lerida庄园\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<hr style=\"letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;border-right-width: 0px;border-bottom-width: 0px;border-left-width: 0px;border-style: solid;border-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.098);transform: scale(1, 0.5);transform-origin: 0px 0px;\"/>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Lerida庄园的历史特别的丰富，它历经了3个家族/家庭；\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7R1wyw8gGW5DPDxksOpPQNlWWXUibXMibvhWvX7vT5Rf6W7KIkXdRFLW79ibywkcz7gLpic99FOmjZVaw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          1911年，\n          <span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n           当时来建造巴拿马运河的挪威工程师Toleff Bache Mönniche和妻子Julia搬到巴拿马，辗转了几个地方，最终选择了现在的Alto Quiel；\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n          1924年，他\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n          按照老家的风格搭建了住所，随后利用自己专长技术发明了当时独特的干湿一体处理厂，同时也设计发明“sifon”虹吸式咖啡果实处理系统(分离水洗制程水槽中密度不够的漂浮豆，现在这款机器已在全世界咖啡产地广泛使用)并获得专利；‍\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7R1wyw8gGW5DPDxksOpPQNlG1EQNic816Oo3LLKGFUAugESHic2lxiauqZ8tWDHz2SKibGib6Rr3unMN5A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          1929年，Lerida第一次出口咖啡豆到德国，也对后面巴拿马咖啡再欧洲以至于全球消费市场的名誉奠定了基础；\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          ‍‍‍\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          农场一直运营到60年代，转由一对美国夫妇Alfredo 和Inga Collins接棒，后续和他们的儿子Hans和Charlie Collins一直继续管理运营到2000年左右；随后现在的庄园主，波奎特土生土长的Maria Antonella Amoruso在2008年将农场购买过来，拓展规模和区域到现在一共5个农场，除了Lerida之外，其余4个分别是在Jaramillo区域的Amelia 和Esplendorosa农场以及在Volcancito区域Flora和Michella。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7R1wyw8gGW5DPDxksOpPQNl0DBMQibyqRr1jxTFicHlduKnp6ibkPfpr0g4NiaTiaMibkI06FvVT1qwicZYg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n          Lerida的位置位于\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n          波奎特(Boquete) 的巴鲁火山(Baru Volcano)区，特殊的微型气候，2000毫米充沛的降雨量，早晚温差够大，加上充满养分的火山土壤，细腻的採收期规划以及严谨的水洗发酵监控与天然日晒控管，使这裡生产的咖啡，在厚实度与酸度上都表现相当优异。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TgaZxq21LYakiawP0AJaFkL1zVQys2bicLyicEP5BibjR2qxsBecE16O2Fic2na8ro1PlLIERicd47ldqg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Lerida不仅是个知名精品庄园，同时也是著名的生态休闲旅馆，这样的收入搭配可以让农场专注于维持庄园丰富的生物多样性，及保护农场周围旺盛的原始热带雨林。在雨林里有超过500种不同的鸟类，也让赏鸟成为大特点。常有国际著名生态学家与鸟类专家前来本庄园住宿兼研究！\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7R1wyw8gGW5DPDxksOpPQNlJwb2DGC8utibBflpRDrsnXnS3xY6DOuXQ33YND31FGD3r8jMCB236iag/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7R1wyw8gGW5DPDxksOpPQNle3R4cjeJbKY3ic2PNIEhcEOe8I8GHuic00uaK1KTNVOnjmIc1kgHxo4Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n<br/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style='color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n          更多咖啡豆选购，请关注淘宝店铺哦～\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<span style='font-size: 14px;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style='outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n          <img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7RicESSboT2yAGicv25eicYwA9eYTVnj6tnDXYWHJ5amUjBqzNK6pdB5dhozgCKLqOuf9IgicGe5pVLibQ/640?wx_fmt=other&amp;wxfrom=10005&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1&amp;tp=webp\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: normal;text-align: start;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);color: rgb(0, 0, 0);visibility: visible !important;width: 578px !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
